<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - VHS H1 NET 5.8 MILLION GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>TABLE - VHS H1 NET 5.8 MILLION GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     0.58 vs   0.56</p>
<p>    Net profit			     5.8  vs   5.5</p>
<p>    Pre-tax net profit		   8.9  vs   6.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Property fund VHS Onroerend Goed Maatschappij NV said</p>
<p>it would further increase its property portfolio. The company</p>
<p>said it maintained its forecast that 1997 full-year net profit</p>
<p>would be substantially higher than 1996's 13.1 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
